1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,410
(Sheldon:)A juvenile amalgamation
of our names.

2
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,940
Sheldon, Amy-- Shamy.

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,280
(Sheldon:)Oh.

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,280
(Amy:)I don't like that.

5
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,330
(Amy:)Don't do that.

6
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:11,060
(awkward chuckle)

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,410
(Penny:)All righty. What's new?

8
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:15,000
(Amy:)Well, just recently, I learned
that you refer to us as Shamy,

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,240
(Amy:)and I don't like that.

10
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,070
(Penny:)I got it.

11
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:20,860
(Penny:)But what I was going for was,
you know, how's your life?

12
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,680
(Amy:)Like everybody else's.

13
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,790
(Amy:)Subject to entropy,
decay and eventual death.

14
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,480
(Amy:)Thank you for asking.

15
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,270
(Amy:)Why is she not taking our order?

16
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,470
(Sheldon:)I should've warned you,

17
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:34,940
(Sheldon:)one has to navigate a
labyrinth of social nonsense

18
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,610
(Sheldon:)before one can be fed here.

19
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:37,940
AMY: Really?

20
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,640
(Amy:)I assumed an establishment called

21
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,440
(Amy:)the Cheesecake Factory would
function more efficiently.

22
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,760
(Sheldon:)It's how they lure you in.

23
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,030
I believe it's called "
bait and switch."

24
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:48,900
(Penny:)Okay, I'm just gonna walk away,

25
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,990
(Penny:)'cause... I don't want to be here.

26
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,930
(Leonard:)So, this is nice.

27
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,780
(Leonard:)First time we've all
gotten together to eat.

28
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:03,020
(Amy:)You're right, he's a
festival of humdrum chitchat.

